    "title": "School Views: Finding the right school fit - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Christina Gosselin School Views ,\n12 hours ago At Eagle County School District, we understand that education isn’t a one-size-fits-all experience. All of our traditional schools offer academic support and scaffolded instruction to meet the needs of individual learners, but sometimes it’s the traditional classroom experience that isn’t quite the right learning environment for a student. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
